sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Manager / Reviewer
    participant C as PricingExceptionsController
    participant S as PricingExceptionService
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    M->>C: CreatePricingExceptionRequestAsync
    C->>S: CreatePricingExceptionRequestAsync
    S->>S: ExecuteIdempotentWriteAsync
    S->>D: Create request, revision 1, history and retry result
    M->>C: RecordPricingExceptionDecisionAsync
    C->>S: ReviewPricingExceptionRequestAsync
    S->>D: Save decision for the exact current revision
    M->>C: SubmitPricingExceptionRevisionAsync
    C->>S: SubmitRequestRevisionAsync
    S->>D: New revision becomes Pending, retain previous decision
